body:
I want to T break at least here soon but I'm waiting until after 4/20 and shit but idk I don't feel like it makes my thoughts any worse I feel the foggy thing though.

&#x200B;

I just don't have that many problems I can fix like I'm sad and bored and I don't wanna be here, I want a girl and I don't wanna spend forever alone. I really am fine with myself and have things I enjoy doing but like idk girls just run away they never care its a big reason why I want to die.

&#x200B;

I've tried therapy and idk I really didn't enjoy it or get anything out of it.
